# Cardtan

The boardgame we all know and love using cards instead of dice to reduce luck.

[Playable Link](https://parzxval.github.io/NoLuckCatan/)

## Asset Attributions

- click.wav by annabloom -- <https://freesound.org/s/219069/> -- License: Attribution NonCommercial 4.0
- place.wav by MiloJezzy -- <https://freesound.org/s/658417/> -- License: Creative Commons 0

- All image assets are hand-drawn by me in Sketchbook (Galaxy Tablet and Spen) and cropped in Samsung Gallery.
- Audio assets are slightly cropped in Microsoft Clipchamp to lessen duration.

## Requirements

- Scenes: Menu, GameSetup, GameScene, VictoryScene
- 2+ Audio Assets: click.wav, place.wav plays on icon clicks and building placements.
- 2+ Image Assets: card images, building/road images, and resource images
- 2+ Geometric Shapes: rectangles for buttons, slider tracks, circles for vertex placement dots and slider handles
- Logotype Text: cardtan.png shown as the title on the menu screen
- Multi-line Text Block: info tooltip in gamesetup and turn/player text
- Fading Scene Transition: GameScene faded in from black
- Object Motion Animation: dropIntoPlace() drops roads/settlements using a tween
